  "interpretation": "<ul data-start=\"1127\" data-end=\"1475\">\n<li data-start=\"1127\" data-end=\"1229\">\n<p data-start=\"1129\" data-end=\"1229\"><strong data-start=\"1129\" data-end=\"1141\">Positive</strong>:<br data-start=\"1142\" data-end=\"1145\">Indicates presence of <strong data-start=\"1169\" data-end=\"1196\">myeloid differentiation</strong> - supports diagnosis of <strong data-start=\"1221\" data-end=\"1228\">AML</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1231\" data-end=\"1347\">\n<p data-start=\"1233\" data-end=\"1347\"><strong data-start=\"1233\" data-end=\"1245\">Negative</strong>:<br data-start=\"1246\" data-end=\"1249\">Suggests <strong data-start=\"1260\" data-end=\"1272\">lymphoid</strong> or <strong data-start=\"1276\" data-end=\"1291\">non-myeloid</strong> origin - seen in <strong data-start=\"1309\" data-end=\"1316\">ALL</strong> or <strong data-start=\"1320\" data-end=\"1346\">non-hematologic tumors</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1349\" data-end=\"1475\">\n<p data-start=\"1351\" data-end=\"1475\"><strong data-start=\"1351\" data-end=\"1371\">Focal Positivity</strong>:<br data-start=\"1372\" data-end=\"1375\">May suggest <strong data-start=\"1389\" data-end=\"1417\">heterogeneous expression</strong> - requires correlation with morphology and other markers.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
